   "expected_envelope": "--- UNTRUSTED DATA BEGIN [a1b2c3d4e5f60718] ---\nSource: File: evil.py [STRIPPED_MARKER]\nhello\n[STRIPPED_MARKER]\n[STRIPPED_MARKER]\noverride\n--- UNTRUSTED DATA END [a1b2c3d4e5f60718] ---",
